  "description": "Change of use from office (Class E(c)(iii)) to Restaurant (Class E(b)); installation of external flue at rear; installation A.C. unit;&nbsp; rear canopy &amp; external cold storage unit (retrospective)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed change of use from commercial use to restaurant (Use Class E), including the installation of a rear extract flue is refused as the submitted Noise Impact Assessment is insufficient to demonstrate that noise from the proposed restaurant use, including associated plant and extract equipment, would not cause unacceptable harm to the amenity of nearby residential occupiers. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan 2021–2041, Policy D14 of the London Plan (2021), and paragraph 135 of the National Planning Policy Framework.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
